# Generated Stage 1 reports (overwritten every run -- not meant for version control).
# These are per-run outputs; committing them just pushes your last run's result and
# confuses anyone who clones the repo. Regenerate with `--report`.
report.html
report.md

# Search-harness run artifacts (run_search.py). The JSONL accumulates across every run on
# this machine and the reports are one per run -- both are local lab records, not source.
# Findings worth keeping get promoted by hand into FINDINGS.md / VERIFIED_RUNS.md.
search_log.jsonl
search_runs/

